-16T07:32:08Z", "username": "Naman Maheshwari", "text": "I might have ideas for a themed restaurant", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:32:23Z", "username": "Naman Maheshwari", "text": "Definitely original", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:32:30Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "I have always harbored a desire to open a proper Bollywood reference restaurant", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:32:49Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Only true connoisseurs will understand the references", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:33:18Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "When I was in undergrad and starbucks was new in India (when people lined up for it), I had an idea to recreate the menu of expensive coffee shops at an affordable price point and name it “Aukaat Cafe”", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:33:44Z", "username": "Naman Maheshwari", "text": "Starupees", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:33:59Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "In fact - I often go to a Bollywood quiz here in Dubai where you have to choose team names everytime - I have been in teams like Pyaar Vyapaar Ki Jodi, I.T.U.S, Frankie Ramdayal, Farhanitrate, you name it", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:34:08Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Best restaurant idea was Biswa’s, fancy French restaurant “Le Bencho”", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:34:56Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Frankie Ramdayal is a deep cut 👌", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:35:16Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Aukaat Latte and Aukaat se bahar Latte", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:35:28Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Shole with Om Puri.... where the puri has ajwain sprinkled on it", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:35:34Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Dance Matcha", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:35:44Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Second one has almond milk", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:35:50Z", "username": "Naman Maheshwari", "text": "Rab ne bana di pakodi", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:36:00Z", "username": "Naman Maheshwari", "text": "Rab ne bana Tea Pakodi*", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:36:34Z", "username": "Naman Maheshwari", "text": "Thanks for validating my garbage sense of humour, guys!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:36:34Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "My wife and I were MBA classmates and then both got into consulting thereafter. At our wedding, we had a DYI bar menu of which one drink was “Staffed on the beach”", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:37:00Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DA0zys1ygrO ‎<This message was edited>", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-16T07:37:10Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Creative", "role": "cha